[ti:Echo in the dark]
[re: Subtitle Edit]
[ve: 5.5.0.11]

[00:05.20]Hey God, are you there,
[00:07.96]Or just an echo in the dark?
[00:10.90]I whisper, I scream,
[00:13.60]But I’m still talking to my own heart.
[00:16.43]I keep climbing, I keep breaking,
[00:18.06]Hands are bloody from the fight.
[00:19.63]Every prayer feels like smoke,
[00:20.98]Rising, fading out of sight.
[00:22.37]I’ve been searching, I’ve been clawing,
[00:23.97]Through this silence, through the night.
[00:25.33]But the heavens stay so quiet.
[00:26.78]Were you ever in my life?
[00:28.72]You said you love me,
[00:30.54]Then why do I feel forgotten?
[00:34.08]You said there’s a plan,
[00:36.09]But all I see is ruin.
[00:39.46]I trusted you, I needed you,
[00:42.27]But you did nothing, are you even real?
[00:45.20]Just a ghost in the sky,
[00:46.86]Or a bedtime story for the desperate to feel.
[00:50.54]Do you enjoy this?! Watching me rot?
[00:52.94]Tearing my soul apart just to make sense of the plot.
[00:56.07]Tell me, God, do you feel anything at all?
[00:58.93]I’m screaming your name, but all I hear is the fall.
[01:01.75]I gave you my heart, I laid it bare,
[01:04.63]And you turned away like you were never there.
[01:07.51]You let me stumble, you let me drown,
[01:10.40]You let me bleed out while you stood on the ground.
[01:13.20]I still want you here, I don’t know why.
[01:16.06]I curse your name, but I still cry to the sky.
[01:18.93]I hate you, God, but I miss you more.
[01:21.78]Every time I shut the door, I find myself crawling back for more.
[01:25.60] God, please… If you’re there, if you’ve ever been there,
[01:29.03]I need you now, I need you to care.
[01:31.72]I don’t think I can survive without you, and I don’t want to try.
[01:36.42]If you’re listening, prove it. If you’re real, then show it.
[01:42.33]Because this silence is killing me faster than any blade could cut me open.
[01:48.01]I trusted you, I needed you, but you did nothing, tell me, is this truth?
[01:53.45]Are you a Father, a Savior, or just a ghost I’ve been praying to?
[01:58.86]You let me fall, you let me break, you let me shatter like glass on the floor.
[02:04.60]You let me drown, you let me ache, you let me beg for something more.
[02:10.48]Tell me, God do you laugh when I bleed?
[02:13.17]Do you smile when I’m crawling on broken knees?
[02:16.32]Nights are colder, days are long.
[02:18.94]Every breath feels heavier, every heartbeat wrong.
[02:21.78]You said, “Be still,” but all I feel is rage.
[02:24.64]Locked in this silence, like a bird in a cage.
[02:27.53]If faith is the test, then I’m failing you hard.
[02:30.38]But what kind of God watches scars turn to scars?
[02:33.39]Tell me, God do you laugh when I bleed?
[02:36.08]Do you smile when I’m crawling on broken knees?
[02:39.15]Nights are colder, days are long.
[02:41.72]Every breath feels heavier, every heartbeat wrong.
[02:44.63]You said, “Be still,” but all I feel is rage.
[02:47.50]Locked in this silence, like a bird in a cage.
[02:50.32]If faith is the test, then I’m failing you hard.
[02:53.39]But what kind of God watches scars turn to scars?
[02:56.09]Tell me, God do you laugh when I bleed?
[02:58.77]Do you smile when I’m crawling on broken knees?
[03:01.99]Nights are colder, days are long.
[03:04.64]Every breath feels heavier, every heartbeat wrong.
[03:07.48]You said, “Be still,” but all I feel is rage.
[03:10.36]Locked in this silence, like a bird in a cage.
[03:13.69]I trusted you, I needed you,
[03:16.65]but you did nothing, still I call your name.
[03:19.58]A ghost in the sky, a whisper, a shadow,
[03:22.82]or maybe the silence is mine to blame.
[03:25.25]I still want you,
[03:26.40]I still crave you, even as I curse your throne.
[03:31.06]I hate you, God, but I miss you more,
[03:33.86]and I can’t survive on my own.
[03:36.05]God…
[03:37.45]If you’re there…
[03:39.12]If you’ve ever been there…
[03:40.18]I need you now. Please don’t leave me alone.
[03:43.19]God…
[03:44.65]God, are you there?